    {
      "id": "23o4Ux7lYefu56jv49mao",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 726.8265380859375,
      "y": 362.5140686035156,
      "width": 613.9595947265625,
      "height": 725,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1403579324,
      "version": 1055,
      "versionNonce": 1642937532,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789437638963,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Enter total monthly intake\n\nThree blocks with add/edit/delete\nSavings is automatically total monthly - set budgets\n\nBottom should say if overbudgeted\n\nFor needs and wants add as many as 10 categories\nSavings can have multiple blocks but by default is one main one\n\nbudgetEntry:{\n amountAllocated: number\n amountAdded: number\n}\n\nFinal shape:\nbudget_userId_mm:yy: {\n needs: {\n   budgetEntryMap\n },\nwants:{\n   budgetEntryMap\n},\nsavings: {\n    budgetEntryMap\n}\n\ncreatedAt: FirebaseTimestamp\nupdatedAt: FirebaseTimestamp",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Enter total monthly intake\n\nThree blocks with add/edit/delete\nSavings is automatically total monthly - set budgets\n\nBottom should say if overbudgeted\n\nFor needs and wants add as many as 10 categories\nSavings can have multiple blocks but by default is one main one\n\nbudgetEntry:{\n amountAllocated: number\n amountAdded: number\n}\n\nFinal shape:\nbudget_userId_mm:yy: {\n needs: {\n   budgetEntryMap\n },\nwants:{\n   budgetEntryMap\n},\nsavings: {\n    budgetEntryMap\n}\n\ncreatedAt: FirebaseTimestamp\nupdatedAt: FirebaseTimestamp",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "a4Hm-VO2EH2HqkJPzbKfS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 126.66636137384381,
      "y": 346.2061863192243,
      "width": 434.919677734375,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2041505668,
      "version": 893,
      "versionNonce": 1976356156,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789437219134,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Transactions\n- once labelled, saved\n- filter labelled, by label, unlabeled\n\n1. pull transactions for this month from fb\n2. labelled total\n3. pull transactions from plaid and dedup\n4. show total spent, show total by budget\nin memory calculation\n\ntransaction: {\n id: from plaid\n amount: number\n label?: one of the labels\n plaidStatus: (cancelled, reversed, compelted,\npending)\n osStatus: labelled, mislabeled, unlablled\n}\n\nPie charts should show days remaining, \n- amount completed per budget\n- if overdrawn, pulls from savings\n- if double overdrawn pulls from balance",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Transactions\n- once labelled, saved\n- filter labelled, by label, unlabeled\n\n1. pull transactions for this month from fb\n2. labelled total\n3. pull transactions from plaid and dedup\n4. show total spent, show total by budget\nin memory calculation\n\ntransaction: {\n id: from plaid\n amount: number\n label?: one of the labels\n plaidStatus: (cancelled, reversed, compelted,\npending)\n osStatus: labelled, mislabeled, unlablled\n}\n\nPie charts should show days remaining, \n- amount completed per budget\n- if overdrawn, pulls from savings\n- if double overdrawn pulls from balance",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XsgTYLXitjQ92Z6xqKBiN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 126.29737219614441,
      "y": 993.5231337149246,
      "width": 371.059814453125,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
